## 🚀 Operational Hunting Strategy
To maximize success, configure your workspace to highlight anomalies that other researchers overlook:

   1. Configure Custom In-Scope Match Rules: Define strict regex configurations within your intercepting proxy to highlight any instance of parameter strings containing fields like redirect, callback, signature, sign, or hash.
   2. Monitor Your Out-Of-Band Infrastructure: Keep an active external interaction tracking utility (such as Burp Collaborator or a custom cloud logging server) running continuously to identify delayed async callbacks or hidden background execution bugs.
   3. Audit the Geographic Layout Variants: Route traffic through residential proxy networks across distinct regions specified within the program criteria (such as Brazil or India) to analyze how input validations and local third-party payment workflows adjust dynamically based on user localization.

